   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>您好  感謝分享成果獲益良多</div><div>我希望把一個檔案夾的多個txt檔斷詞後，放在一個新檔案夾</div><div>單文件處理沒有問題，利用loop時code可能有問題，發生讀不到檔案或無法完成程序，請求協助</div><div>Roger</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;background-color:rgb(238,238,255)\">R: 3.2.3 </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;background-color:rgb(238,238,255)\">語料如附件 </span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;background-color:rgb(238,238,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><div><br></div><div>&lt;</div><div><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">ibrary(tm)</span></div><div>library(jiebaR)</div></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;background-color:rgb(238,238,255)\"><br></span></div><div><div>xdir1 = &quot;~/R/all_ANSI/&quot;</div><div>xdir2 = &quot;~/R/all_ANSI_out/&quot;</div><div>mixseg = worker() </div><div>raw &lt;- list.files(path = xdir1, pattern = &quot;*.txt&quot;)</div><div>for (i in raw) </div><div>{ </div><div>    y = readLines(paste(&quot;xdir1&quot;,.Platform$file.sep,raw[i],sep=&quot;&quot;), warn = F) #問題發生處</div><div>    M = mixseg&lt;=y #問題發生處</div><div>    xpath2 = paste(xdir2,f,sep=&quot;/&quot;)  #問題發生處</div><div>    write(M,xpath2) #問題發生處</div><div>} </div></div><div><br></div><div>&gt;</div><div><br></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
