     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">您好，这是我读取文件用的代码。<br><br><pre><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ff </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">files</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pattern </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;*.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># [1] &quot;2011010501f.txt&quot; &quot;2011010501u.txt&quot; &quot;2011010502u.txt&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># [4] &quot;2011011301u.txt&quot; &quot;2011011401f.txt&quot; &quot;2011011801u.txt&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># [7] &quot;2011011901f.txt&quot; &quot;2011011901u.txt&quot; &quot;2011012001f.txt&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># [10] &quot;2011012101f.txt&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">jiebaR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>cc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bylines </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">f </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ff</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> cc$output </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./out/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br> cc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Warning messages: </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># 1: In readLines(input.r, n = lines, encoding = encoding) : </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># incomplete final line found on &#39;2011010501f.txt&#39;</span></div></code></div><span><br>空行警告可以参考：<br><br></span></pre><a href=\"http://qinwenfeng.com/jiebaR/faq/warnings.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://qinwenfeng.com/jiebaR/faq/warnings.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244565815000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0F_mwvUlTKuZ5b6xfK4h48\">http://qinwenfeng.com/jiebaR/faq/warnings.html</a><br> <br>在 2016年3月12日星期六 UTC+8上午1:56:27，Roger Chen写道：</div>"
    ],
